WEBVTT

00:00:12.740 --> 00:00:14.870
You should take a little rest, Lisa.

00:00:15.180 --> 00:00:18.010
Yeah, take a nice long bath or something.

00:00:18.250 --> 00:00:19.270
Thank you.

00:00:19.650 --> 00:00:21.340
I think I'll do just that.

00:00:28.890 --> 00:00:31.260
I've got a bad feeling brewing.

00:00:31.790 --> 00:00:34.730
<i>He said that the Ocean Puzzle
was put together from</i>

00:00:34.800 --> 00:00:38.560
<i>different cubes of space that have been
cut out of Wonderland.</i>

00:00:38.930 --> 00:00:41.090
<i>That makes it more like a
multidimensional puzzle.</i>

00:00:44.410 --> 00:00:45.530
What?

00:00:47.540 --> 00:00:49.270
Ribbit, ribbit!

00:00:51.050 --> 00:00:52.240
Ribbit, ribbit?

00:00:52.350 --> 00:00:55.050
Welcome to the Toad Cube, ribbit!

00:00:55.050 --> 00:00:57.810
This is the beginning of a very fun game, ribbit.

00:01:10.070 --> 00:01:13.560
What? Has the cube shifted again?

00:01:16.100 --> 00:01:17.330
A sea of mud?!

00:01:19.440 --> 00:01:23.140
If you don't hurry, you're all going to sink, ribbit!

00:01:23.380 --> 00:01:25.070
That would be terrible, ribbit!

00:01:27.380 --> 00:01:28.470
What's going on?

00:01:28.750 --> 00:01:30.050
We're sinking?!

00:01:31.520 --> 00:01:33.860
The bottom of the sea of mud is connected

00:01:33.860 --> 00:01:37.790
to a pitch-black space where
nothing exists, ribbit.

00:01:37.930 --> 00:01:42.520
It's just like the one you almost
fell into earlier, ribbit.

00:01:42.830 --> 00:01:44.430
Full speed ahead!

00:01:44.430 --> 00:01:45.630
Toad!

00:01:56.850 --> 00:01:57.580
Ribbit, ribbit!

00:01:57.580 --> 00:02:00.550
If you can undo the spell and
return to your old self,

00:02:00.950 --> 00:02:02.680
then you will win, ribbit.

00:02:02.820 --> 00:02:05.050
I'll let you move on to a higher cube, ribbit.

00:02:06.750 --> 00:02:07.910
You better hurry, ribbit.

00:02:08.320 --> 00:02:12.260
It's game over if your ship sinks to
the bottom of the mud, ribbit.

00:02:12.260 --> 00:02:13.520
Ribbit, ribbit!

00:02:15.300 --> 00:02:18.600
Ribbit, ribbit. Well, do your best, ribbit.

00:02:26.270 --> 00:02:27.830
<i>What should I do?!</i>

00:02:28.280 --> 00:02:29.640
Ribbit!

00:02:53.330 --> 00:02:59.140
The light of dawn pours over the vast Earth

00:02:53.330 --> 00:02:59.140
Daichi ni sosogu yoake

00:03:01.010 --> 00:03:06.640
And marks the beginning of our journey

00:03:01.010 --> 00:03:06.640
Tabidatsu toki wo tsugeru

00:03:08.620 --> 00:03:15.750
With our eyes on the future

00:03:08.620 --> 00:03:15.750
Mirai wo mezashi kaketeyuku kaze

00:03:16.220 --> 00:03:21.860
I deeply breathe in the rushing wind

00:03:16.220 --> 00:03:21.860
Kono mune ni suikonda

00:03:25.500 --> 00:03:31.500
The eyes that could only speak in dreams

00:03:25.500 --> 00:03:31.500
Yume dake wo kizamitsuketa hitomi

00:03:33.370 --> 00:03:39.010
Presented us with the path we're to take

00:03:33.370 --> 00:03:39.010
Bokura ni yuku michi wo ataeru

00:03:40.920 --> 00:03:44.720
Fly to the Neverland

00:03:40.920 --> 00:03:44.720
Fly to the Neverland

00:03:44.790 --> 00:03:54.220
Awaken the unlimited courage inside of us

00:03:44.790 --> 00:03:54.220
Kagiri nai yuuki wo mezamesasete

00:04:03.840 --> 00:04:07.330
Welcome to the sea of Wonderland.

00:04:08.710 --> 00:04:12.440
I am Fabula, your guide.

00:04:14.950 --> 00:04:18.650
The lost travelers are searching for
the exit to the Ocean Puzzle.

00:04:19.390 --> 00:04:22.720
But our inventor has...

00:04:23.290 --> 00:04:26.230
Ribbit!

00:04:39.410 --> 00:04:42.870
Detecting an energy distortion
around the submarine!

00:04:43.180 --> 00:04:44.870
We're sinking rapidly!

00:04:45.580 --> 00:04:46.770
What's going to happen?!

00:04:47.020 --> 00:04:48.950
It'll be fine, Sis.

00:04:49.180 --> 00:04:52.950
Cid will be able to pilot the submarine,
even in this muddy mess.

00:04:59.730 --> 00:05:01.250
Cid's not here.

00:05:01.630 --> 00:05:02.820
He was just here.

00:05:04.170 --> 00:05:05.500
Cid!

00:05:09.970 --> 00:05:11.300
Yeah, Cid's not here.

00:05:11.540 --> 00:05:12.610
What did you say?

00:05:12.610 --> 00:05:15.740
Without Cid we can't move the ship, right?

00:05:15.880 --> 00:05:18.370
What's he doing away during
an emergency like this?!

00:05:18.910 --> 00:05:20.740
All hands, search for Cid!

00:05:30.930 --> 00:05:33.620
<i>I can't do anything if I can't change back.</i>

00:05:33.900 --> 00:05:36.390
<i>Man, how do I reverse this magic?!</i>

00:05:37.470 --> 00:05:38.860
Look what I've found!

00:05:39.570 --> 00:05:40.500
<i>Fungo!</i>

00:05:40.840 --> 00:05:41.930
<i>Oh, that's right!</i>

00:05:42.000 --> 00:05:44.140
<i>Someone with a high sense
of perception like you</i>

00:05:44.140 --> 00:05:45.710
<i>should be able to tell that it's me!</i>

00:05:45.710 --> 00:05:46.700
Lunch time, all right!

00:05:53.080 --> 00:05:54.450
Hey, my lunch!

00:05:54.650 --> 00:05:56.550
<i>I'm not your lunch!</i>

00:06:00.420 --> 00:06:02.010
Wait up, lunch!

00:06:06.790 --> 00:06:08.460
<i>I was able to get away somehow.</i>

00:06:09.460 --> 00:06:10.450
<i>This is...</i>

00:06:10.830 --> 00:06:12.270
<i>The shower room?</i>

00:06:16.940 --> 00:06:18.570
<i>Could it be Miss Lisa?</i>

00:06:26.410 --> 00:06:30.080
<i>No, this is wrong. Just because
I'm a frog, it doesn't mean...</i>

00:06:32.350 --> 00:06:33.750
<i>But if it is Miss Lisa,</i>

00:06:33.890 --> 00:06:36.950
<i>then she'll probably be able to use her
Kigen Arts to sense that it's me!</i>

00:06:37.790 --> 00:06:40.190
<i>This is hardly an action
motivated by impure thoughts!</i>

00:06:40.460 --> 00:06:42.790
<i>I have no choice if I'm going to save
everyone from this crisis.</i>

00:06:43.060 --> 00:06:45.590
<i>That's right, this is something I must do!</i>

00:06:51.770 --> 00:06:56.730
I feel like my body has been turned
to water. Oh, how creepy.

00:07:07.050 --> 00:07:08.060
A frog!

00:07:08.060 --> 00:07:09.720
What? What's happened?

00:07:10.090 --> 00:07:11.560
I hate frogs!

00:07:12.690 --> 00:07:13.720
Excuse me!

00:07:15.960 --> 00:07:17.020
A frog?

00:07:20.370 --> 00:07:22.130
<i>That was a horrible sight.</i>

00:07:25.540 --> 00:07:27.470
<i>Chocobo, thank God!</i>

00:07:27.780 --> 00:07:30.470
<i>He's noticed it's me through his animal instincts!</i>

00:07:35.080 --> 00:07:37.020
<i>Chobi, what are you doing?</i>

00:07:42.290 --> 00:07:46.120
A frog! Wow, it's so cute!

00:07:46.460 --> 00:07:50.660
From this day forward, you're going to be
my friend! Right, Keronta?!

00:07:52.670 --> 00:07:53.530
Yu!

00:07:54.500 --> 00:07:55.630
Did you find Cid?

00:07:55.870 --> 00:07:57.960
No, he's not anywhere.

00:08:02.710 --> 00:08:04.440
What is that, a frog?

00:08:04.810 --> 00:08:07.440
Yeah, I'm going to keep him.
His name is Keronta.

00:08:07.880 --> 00:08:09.120
I don't think so!

00:08:09.120 --> 00:08:10.380
This is a Wonderland frog.

00:08:10.490 --> 00:08:13.890
There's no telling what kind of monster
he'll grow up to be!

00:08:14.020 --> 00:08:15.720
But he's already grown up.

00:08:15.860 --> 00:08:17.730
Tadpoles are the ones who grow up into frogs.

00:08:17.530 --> 00:08:18.950
If I say no, then that means no!

00:08:22.630 --> 00:08:24.060
And that's that.

00:08:24.370 --> 00:08:26.960
Aw, Sis, how could you?!

00:08:27.100 --> 00:08:30.800
I just set him free! I'm sure the frog
wanted to get outside too!

00:08:31.240 --> 00:08:32.830
Keronta!

00:08:43.750 --> 00:08:45.450
<i>This isn't just any normal mud.</i>

00:08:45.750 --> 00:08:48.310
<i>This is the combined energy field
of the distorted spaces.</i>

00:08:48.690 --> 00:08:49.820
<i>So, beyond that,</i>

00:08:50.090 --> 00:08:53.390
<i>it's connected to another cube
of the Ocean Puzzle.</i>

00:08:54.360 --> 00:08:58.030
<i>The key to undoing this magic
might be there somewhere!</i>

00:09:12.080 --> 00:09:13.340
<i>Transported successfully!</i>

00:09:21.890 --> 00:09:25.330
This sure is peaceful, isn't it, Chocoimo?

00:09:25.690 --> 00:09:28.720
Quite relaxing, isn't it, Chocobaba?

00:09:29.530 --> 00:09:32.470
Oh? Did you find something?

00:09:35.540 --> 00:09:37.630
I have no clue.

00:09:37.870 --> 00:09:40.430
Let me see.

00:09:40.580 --> 00:09:43.700
We don't need him, or something like that.

00:09:44.150 --> 00:09:47.950
No, we shouldn't totally disregard frogs like that.

00:09:48.380 --> 00:09:50.750
I'm sure you've heard the story too!

00:09:51.220 --> 00:09:54.680
Oh, are you talking about that one legend?

00:09:55.620 --> 00:10:01.890
He was a prince who tried to defeat an evil
sorcerer who wanted to destroy the world.

00:10:02.330 --> 00:10:08.670
But instead, the prince was turned into
an ugly little frog by magic.

00:10:08.670 --> 00:10:10.770
Or at least, that's the rumor.

00:10:10.770 --> 00:10:15.540
But then one fair maiden
had pity on the ugly frog.

00:10:15.680 --> 00:10:18.510
Their hearts connected even though
they couldn't speak to each other.

00:10:18.510 --> 00:10:21.310
Then came the kiss of love...

00:10:22.850 --> 00:10:24.680
And when that happened,

00:10:25.050 --> 00:10:28.720
the prince turned back into his old self,
or something like that!

00:10:29.120 --> 00:10:33.150
That's right, that legend of the Frog Prince!

00:10:33.530 --> 00:10:34.820
<i>Don't tell me...</i>

00:10:35.960 --> 00:10:38.260
So what if this frog too...

00:10:39.770 --> 00:10:41.200
Maybe if we...

00:10:41.870 --> 00:10:43.500
It might just...

00:10:44.040 --> 00:10:45.370
<i>This can't be happening.</i>

00:10:57.550 --> 00:11:00.080
Oh well, I guess this one's just a normal frog.

00:11:00.720 --> 00:11:04.690
After all, a legend is just another kind of rumor.

00:11:04.690 --> 00:11:06.520
Or something like that.

00:11:09.560 --> 00:11:12.860
This sure is peaceful, isn't it, Chocoimo?

00:11:13.100 --> 00:11:16.630
Quite relaxing, isn't it, Chocobaba?

00:11:19.410 --> 00:11:20.640
<i>The Frog Prince!</i>

00:11:24.210 --> 00:11:26.300
<i>That is the key to undoing this magic!</i>

00:11:33.820 --> 00:11:34.980
<i>The Frog Prince...</i>

00:11:35.520 --> 00:11:39.760
<i>That has got to be the way to undo
this magic and clear the cube!</i>

00:11:44.070 --> 00:11:47.970
<i>I need to calculate the
dimensional flux to get back.</i>

00:11:56.540 --> 00:11:58.070
If we continue sinking like this,

00:11:58.550 --> 00:12:01.880
we will reach the lower levels and be
swallowed up by the dark space.

00:12:02.450 --> 00:12:04.990
The engine has been set at full power,

00:12:04.990 --> 00:12:07.180
but there has been no change
in our speed of descent.

00:12:07.390 --> 00:12:10.850
Where in the world is Cid at a time like this?

00:12:15.200 --> 00:12:16.560
A frog!

00:12:17.930 --> 00:12:20.490
A frog! Get rid of it!

00:12:21.500 --> 00:12:23.090
<i>I've got to get a kiss from a maiden.</i>

00:12:23.270 --> 00:12:25.140
<i>Otherwise I'll never become myself again!</i>

00:12:25.440 --> 00:12:27.170
<i>Maiden... maiden...</i>

00:12:30.010 --> 00:12:32.040
<i>All right, I'm going to do it!</i>

00:12:33.880 --> 00:12:35.750
<i>Where could Cid have...</i>

00:12:38.190 --> 00:12:41.180
<i>Miss Lisa! All right, this is my chance!</i>

00:12:46.930 --> 00:12:49.830
<i>What is this perverse flow of energy that I feel?</i>

00:12:59.840 --> 00:13:02.140
What? A frog?

00:13:06.980 --> 00:13:09.280
<i>I should have known Miss Lisa would be tough.</i>

00:13:09.520 --> 00:13:10.380
Keronta!

00:13:12.320 --> 00:13:14.650
I wonder if this is the same frog as before?

00:13:14.990 --> 00:13:15.920
Oh, well.

00:13:16.220 --> 00:13:18.520
This time I just have to
make sure Sis doesn't find you.

00:13:19.030 --> 00:13:22.220
Oh, that's right. Keronta,
you must be hungry, right?

00:13:22.500 --> 00:13:24.090
I'll give you some of my food.

00:13:24.600 --> 00:13:26.830
This is a Wonderland bun that Fungo made!

00:13:28.040 --> 00:13:29.330
Is it good, Keronta?

00:13:29.970 --> 00:13:32.300
Hey! You picked him up again?!

00:13:32.370 --> 00:13:34.400
Sis! Oh, Keronta!

00:13:34.810 --> 00:13:36.830
<i>I'm dead. She's gonna kill me!</i>

00:13:43.620 --> 00:13:46.090
<i>For the time being, I should make
my plan of attack from here.</i>

00:14:14.620 --> 00:14:15.780
<i>A frog...</i>

00:14:18.490 --> 00:14:20.980
<i>I wonder if anyone is
ever going to recognize me?</i>

00:14:21.320 --> 00:14:23.020
I saw that frog too.

00:14:24.660 --> 00:14:26.180
It may not be a normal frog.

00:14:27.260 --> 00:14:28.250
<i>Miss Lisa!</i>

00:14:28.530 --> 00:14:29.690
It's hard to explain,

00:14:29.830 --> 00:14:32.360
but I felt a strange,
perverse spirit coming from it.

00:14:32.500 --> 00:14:34.590
Yeah, see! It is definitely strange
that he's back here,

00:14:34.740 --> 00:14:37.330
even though I flushed him down the toilet!

00:14:37.610 --> 00:14:39.160
But he was so cute...

00:14:39.510 --> 00:14:41.910
This could possibly be a trap from the enemy.

00:14:42.340 --> 00:14:43.540
Don't let your guard down.

00:14:45.080 --> 00:14:47.810
In any case, let's go ahead and split up,
and search for Cid.

00:14:47.950 --> 00:14:51.880
And if we see the frog,
we'll stomp it flat right away!

00:14:55.290 --> 00:14:57.480
I see the frog! There he is!

00:14:58.330 --> 00:15:00.450
<i>Oh, how cruel! Even Miss Lisa...</i>

00:15:00.830 --> 00:15:03.300
<i>What have I done to them to deserve this?!</i>

00:15:11.340 --> 00:15:15.000
<i>This is useless. I'll be a frog forever.</i>

00:15:15.410 --> 00:15:17.710
<i>We'll never clear this cube of the Ocean Puzzle.</i>

00:15:32.360 --> 00:15:33.720
<i>Who...</i>

00:15:39.800 --> 00:15:42.030
There is still no change in our speed of descent.

00:15:43.200 --> 00:15:44.200
What about Cid?

00:15:44.200 --> 00:15:45.400
Nowhere to be found.

00:15:45.610 --> 00:15:48.070
We're just about at the bottom of the mud.

00:15:48.810 --> 00:15:52.680
We've got to do everything in our power
to make sure that doesn't happen.

00:15:58.790 --> 00:15:59.880
<i>What?</i>

00:16:00.490 --> 00:16:02.820
<i>Oh, what a nice, soft bed.</i>

00:16:10.900 --> 00:16:14.270
<i>Miles? Oh, so that was you?</i>

00:16:14.770 --> 00:16:18.530
<i>Thank you, it's so nice of you
to treat my wounds like this.</i>

00:16:21.010 --> 00:16:23.270
<i>But this medicine sure is sour.</i>

00:16:24.650 --> 00:16:26.040
<i>Mayonnaise?!</i>

00:16:29.950 --> 00:16:31.920
Now this will be one tasty frog!

00:16:33.790 --> 00:16:38.490
<i>Oh, no! I forgot that frogs
are Miles' favorite food!</i>

00:16:39.160 --> 00:16:42.290
Down the hatch!

00:16:42.630 --> 00:16:43.720
In that case...

00:17:00.980 --> 00:17:02.920
All right!

00:17:03.420 --> 00:17:04.940
Woohoo!

00:17:08.760 --> 00:17:11.620
I undid your magic. I've won this one!

00:17:11.930 --> 00:17:13.450
Please take us up to the cube above.

00:17:14.430 --> 00:17:17.760
Good job, ribbit, but you were just
a tad bit too late, ribbit.

00:17:18.000 --> 00:17:20.060
The ship is already at the bottom of the mud,

00:17:20.200 --> 00:17:22.630
and there's nothing you can do about it, ribbit.

00:17:22.900 --> 00:17:25.030
But that's not what you promised!

00:17:25.240 --> 00:17:27.710
Anything you might try doing now
would just be a waste, ribbit.

00:17:27.840 --> 00:17:29.970
Just give up, ribbit.

00:17:31.110 --> 00:17:32.580
Damn it!

00:17:35.520 --> 00:17:36.480
Cid?!

00:17:36.480 --> 00:17:37.880
Cid, where have you been?

00:17:38.120 --> 00:17:39.280
I'll explain later!

00:17:40.390 --> 00:17:41.450
We've got to escape!

00:17:41.890 --> 00:17:43.650
Full speed ahead, all engines at full throttle!

00:17:44.260 --> 00:17:46.560
Oh yeah, about that...

00:17:48.060 --> 00:17:52.160
While we were trying to escape,
we sort of overheated the engines,

00:17:52.470 --> 00:17:53.870
and they broke.

00:17:54.130 --> 00:17:55.260
Broke?!

00:17:56.040 --> 00:17:58.940
You were nowhere to be found,
and there was this frog...

00:17:59.310 --> 00:18:00.970
A frog?

00:18:00.970 --> 00:18:04.640
You chase me around, and then break my Jane!

00:18:06.680 --> 00:18:07.580
Cid...

00:18:07.880 --> 00:18:09.370
Just like before!

00:18:11.150 --> 00:18:14.090
We've hit bottom! Jane is falling down!

00:18:15.460 --> 00:18:18.130
Fine, then! No matter what it takes,

00:18:18.130 --> 00:18:21.090
I'm going to get Jane to the cube above!

00:18:29.940 --> 00:18:32.870
Cut the outside maneuvering power!
Release reserve circuits!

00:18:34.010 --> 00:18:36.670
Maintain sub energy!
Elenium, maximum power!

00:18:37.080 --> 00:18:38.370
Engine, full throttle!

00:18:40.050 --> 00:18:41.670
Begin calculating the surrounding
potential energy!

00:18:42.180 --> 00:18:43.910
Find any tears in the distorted dimension,

00:18:44.180 --> 00:18:46.910
and from there we will move into another cube!

00:18:47.650 --> 00:18:49.590
What do you want us to do?

00:18:52.530 --> 00:18:55.890
Just hold on tight and pray to your ancestors.

00:19:13.750 --> 00:19:15.010
That's it!

00:19:21.490 --> 00:19:25.190
Go!

00:19:48.580 --> 00:19:49.670
You did it!

00:19:50.750 --> 00:19:52.280
Wow, awesome!

00:19:52.790 --> 00:19:54.190
Good work, Cid!

00:19:54.450 --> 00:19:56.420
We knew we couldn't have
done anything without you!

00:19:56.690 --> 00:19:58.520
For real, where have you been this whole time?

00:19:58.860 --> 00:20:00.760
We looked for you for so long.

00:20:00.860 --> 00:20:04.490
Jane! I'm so sorry!

00:20:05.230 --> 00:20:06.430
Cid?

00:20:07.530 --> 00:20:10.260
I'm really sorry, Jane!

00:20:10.700 --> 00:20:14.400
Don't worry, I'll fix your engine right away, okay?

00:20:17.110 --> 00:20:18.370
<i>A frog...</i>

00:20:32.900 --> 00:20:36.500
And now the journey begins

00:20:32.900 --> 00:20:36.500
Soshite tabi wa hajimaru

00:20:36.550 --> 00:20:40.100
Just the two of us going off

00:20:36.550 --> 00:20:40.100
Kimi to futari doko ka e

00:20:40.150 --> 00:20:43.650
Trance Euro Express passes through the night

00:20:40.150 --> 00:20:43.650
Trance Euro Express hashirisaru

00:20:43.700 --> 00:20:47.250
Riding into the distance

00:20:43.700 --> 00:20:47.250
Toorisugiru yakei ni

00:20:47.300 --> 00:20:50.750
Let me hear more of your heart

00:20:47.300 --> 00:20:50.750
Motto kokoro kikasete

00:20:50.850 --> 00:20:54.400
Let me close my eyes and be intoxicated

